    {
      "id": "claim_964a0e3ba2b84d4fbb4e672cd4752b66",
      "statement": "ElementType (ET) is a component or part in the master product catalogue (DesignDB) with a reference code, name, and optional family category. ElementTypes are hierarchical: collections are virtual container ETs that group related ETs by family; leaf ETs are real products.",
