    {
      "id": "claim_2f12f9d4b53a4b60bbc9bf4e83db1caf",
      "statement": "A Recipe is a specification of parts for a PositionType, defining which ElementTypes go into that position with quantities and flags (IsDesign, IsContractItem, IsDeleted). Each recipe row (Ingredient) carries ElementTypeRef, Quantity or Dim_QuantityMultiplier, and section (position level or internal).",
