      "statement": "A Wrapper is a virtual assembly or container ET identified by refs starting with ET-DL- or ET-LIN- that holds components internally. Positions using a wrapper have rows at position level and internal rows inside the wrapper; wrappers can be shared across positions with identical internals.",
